<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers one trillion yen 2.7% 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers one trillion yen 2.7% 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday it was offering one trillion yen worth of 2.7 percent 10-year bonds through a price competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be June 20, 1997 and maturity date will be June 20, 2007.</p>
</text>
